+# Music Video pack changes
+
+## 0.6.0 — prepared, not released
+
+- Section affect evidence binds approved local chord estimates, rhythm, dynamics and reliable lyric alignment to exact source bytes. Emotional meaning remains bounded inference with explicit uncertainty, conflict and abstention.
+- Explicit desired video affect survives re-recording and reaches Pattern Fit, Treatment and Visual Arc prompt directives while detected song affect remains visible.
+- New `record_affect` writes on this pack require the versioned evidence through the existing Brief writer. Older pinned packs and existing artifacts without the extension retain their previous contract. No project schema migration is introduced.
+- The pack requires additive EngineContract 10 for the new evidence API. The engine compatibility floor remains 2; the marketing-version minimum is unchanged. No release is implied by this entry.
+
+Prepared structural fixtures cover source tampering, conflicting and absent signals, override persistence, actual consumers and legacy preservation. GitHub Actions and attributed creative/runtime review remain pending.
